<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>School Facilities</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #eef7ff;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .facilities {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #f5f9ff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .card h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        @media(max-width: 600px) {
            .facilities {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>🏫 School Facilities</h1>

    <p>
        A good educational institution provides different facilities
        to support students in their learning and development.
    </p>

    <div class="facilities">

        <div class="card">
            <h2>📚 Library</h2>
            <p>
                A quiet place where students can read books,
                newspapers and reference materials.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>💻 Computer Lab</h2>
            <p>
                A laboratory where students can practice programming
                and computer-related activities.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>🔬 Science Lab</h2>
            <p>
                A place where students can learn science through
                practical activities.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>⚽ Sports Ground</h2>
            <p>
                A space for students to participate in sports
                and physical activities.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>🎨 Activity Room</h2>
            <p>
                A space for creative activities, competitions
                and student events.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>🧑‍🏫 Classrooms</h2>
            <p>
                Learning spaces where teachers and students
                interact during lessons.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
